### ========================================
### MyPlanner API 测试脚本
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件执行
### 或直接用 curl 命令
### ========================================

### 1. 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "abc12345"
}

### 2. 注册 - 参数错误（用户名太短）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "abc12345"
}

### 3. 注册 - 用户名已存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "abc12345"
}

### 4. 用户登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "abc12345"
}

### 5. 登录 - 密码错误
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpass"
}

### ========================================
### 以下请求需要先调用登录接口，把返回的 token 填入 @token 变量
### ========================================
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. 创建任务
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "学习 Vue.js",
  "description": "对比 React 和 Vue 的异同",
  "dueDate": "2026-07-01"
}

### 7. 创建任务 - 仅标题
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "快速创建任务"
}

### 8. 查询任务列表（默认分页）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 查询任务列表 - 筛选状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=TODO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 查询任务列表 - 关键字搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?keyword=Spring
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 查询任务列表 - 分页
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?page=1&size=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 更新任务（替换 {id} 为实际任务ID）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "更新后的标题",
  "description": "更新描述"
}

### 13. 切换任务状态为 DONE
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### 14. 切换任务状态为 TODO
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "TODO"
}

### 15. 批量切换任务状态为 DONE（替换 ID 为实际任务ID）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/batch/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3],
  "status": "DONE"
}

### 16. 删除任务（替换 {id} 为实际任务ID）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. 批量删除任务（替换 ID 为实际任务ID）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

### 18. 无 Token 访问（应返回 401）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### 19. Token 过期或非法（应返回 401）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer invalidtoken123

### ========================================
### AI 对话相关接口
### ========================================

### 20. 创建对话会话
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "新对话"
}

### 21. 创建对话会话 - 默认标题
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### 22. 获取会话列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. 重命名会话（替换 {id} 为实际会话ID）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "学习计划讨论"
}

### 24. 获取会话历史消息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. 发送消息（SSE 流式响应）
### 注意：VS Code REST Client 支持 SSE，每条 data 是一个 JSON 事件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions/1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "content": "帮我规划本周的学习计划"
}

### 26. 单条消息转任务（替换 {id} 为实际消息ID）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/messages/1/to-task
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "学习 Spring AI",
  "description": "阅读官方文档并跑通示例",
  "dueDate": "2026-07-20"
}

### 27. 抽取会话内全部任务候选
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions/1/extract-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. 批量创建候选任务为待办
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat/tasks/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "复习 Java 基础",
      "description": "重点复习集合框架",
      "dueDate": "2026-07-18"
    },
    {
      "title": "完成 MyBatis-Plus 练习",
      "description": null,
      "dueDate": null
    }
  ]
}

### 29. 删除会话（级联删除消息，替换 {id} 为实际会话ID）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 30. 越权访问他人会话（应返回 404，不会泄露会话是否存在）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat/sessions/99999/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
